Hi Till,

I have PWG meetings on Thursday (some not every
week, but at irregular intervals) as follows:

11am EDT to 12pm EDT - PMP (MIB) / IPP WGs
12pm EDT to 1pm EDT   - WIMS WG (CIM Model)
3pm EDT to 4pm EDT - MFD WG (Multifunction)
4:10pm EDT to 5:10pm EDT - PWG Steering Committee

So my open times are before 8am PDT (11am EDT)
(too early on the US west coast) and also between
10am PDT (1pm EDT) and 12pm PDT (3pm EDT)
(6pm Western Europe Summer to 8pm WEST).

Please announce the Printing Summit planning calls,
starting Thursday 26 July, I think?

Cheers,
